# Web (Emscripten) build of the wgrender simple example: simple.js + simple.wasm.
#
# Run `./build.py web`: it builds wgrender's web library, then writes
# build/web/<variant>/build.hxml (build/web/webgl2-nothreads/, ...): this file,
# wgrender's own emcc compile and link flags (so this build always matches how the
# library was built), and the target, --cpp build/web/<variant>/cpp.

-cp src
-lib wgrender-hx
--main Simple
# hxcpp's emscripten toolchain: emcc for everything, wasm out, single-threaded
# (which also lets its GC take some shortcuts).
-D emscripten
-D HAXE_OUTPUT_FILE=simple

-dce full
-D analyzer-optimize
